# Radioactive Spider {G}, 1/1: "Fateful Bite - {2}, Sacrifice this creature: Search your library for a Spider Hero card, reveal it, put it into your hand,
# then shuffle. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1's library holds a Giant Spider (a Spider, no Hero), a Gwen Stacy (a Hero, her front face no Spider) and a
# Masked Meower (Spider Cat Hero) and a Spider-Man, Web-Slinger (Spider Human Hero): the first two are refused, so is taking both Spider Heroes ("a
# ... card" is one), and the Meower alone is found and revealed. Bot2's library holds a Masked Meower too, which stays
# there. Mox Ruby and Mox Jet pay exactly {2}; the Spider is sacrificed, so it is in the graveyard.

